            "page": 8,
            "text": "9. Pricing Summary (2026) \nMeta switched from per-conversation billing to per-message billing in July 2025. You are \nnow charged for each individual template message delivered, not per 24-hour \nconversation window. \nKey pricing rules to know: \n\u2022Service messages (replies within 24 hrs of user-initiated message) are always free \n\u2022Utility templates sent within an open 24-hour customer service window are free \n\u2022All templates sent within a 72-hour CTWA/FEP window are free (biggest cost saver) \n\u2022Marketing messages to US numbers (+1) are currently paused by Meta (since April \n2025) \n\u2022Pricing varies by recipient\u2019s country code \u2014 not your business location \n\u2022India marketing messages cost approximately \u20b90.90/message; Germany costs ~\u20b911.50/\nmessage \n10. Frequently Asked Questions"
