            "page": 2,
            "text": "\u2022You receive an email alert from Meta \n\u2022You must update the payment method and clear any outstanding balance \n\u2022WeNext cannot unblock this \u2014 it must be resolved directly in your Meta Business \nManager \n4. WhatsApp Messaging Tiers & Limits \n4.1  What are messaging tiers? \nMeta limits how many unique users your business can message per 24 hours. These \nlimits are called tiers and apply to your entire Business Portfolio (not per phone number) \nsince October 2025. All phone numbers under your Business Manager share the same \ntier. \n\u2fa0 Important: This is one of the most common blockers we see. Clients assume WeNext handles \nbilling with Meta. We do not. You must add your own payment method directly in Meta Business \nManager."
          }
        ]
