        "sources": [
          {
            "page": 0,
            "text": "AI PDF Copilot - Complete Implementation Guide\n (5-Day Sprint)\nObjective\nBuild a production-style AI PDF Copilot by Friday and demonstrate it on Saturday. The guide is\nintentionally written so that another LLM can use it as a complete project specification and generate\nthe required code module-by-module.\nProject Specification\n\u007f Frontend: Streamlit\n\u007f Language: Python\n\u007f LLM: Groq (Llama 3 preferred)\n\u007f Framework: LangChain\n\u007f Vector Database: Chroma\n\u007f PDF Loader: PyPDFLoader\n\u007f Embeddings: HuggingFace Embeddings\n\u007f Project Type: Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) AI Copilot\nFinal Features\n\u007f Upload one or multiple PDFs.\n\u007f Automatically extract text, split into chunks and index the content.\n\u007f Chat with uploaded PDFs using RAG.\n\u007f Generate short, detailed and bullet summaries."
          },
          {
            "page": 4,
            "text": "Thursday - Study Mode\nTasks\n\u007f Generate MCQs.\n\u007f Generate True/False questions.\n\u007f Generate Short Answer questions.\n\u007f Generate Flashcards.\n\u007f Generate Suggested Questions.\n\u007f Display document statistics (pages, words, chunks, reading time).\n\u007f Implement Study Mode button that automatically generates Summary, Key Takeaways, Quiz,\nFlashcards and Suggested Questions.\n\u007f Deliverable: Complete AI PDF Copilot functionality.\nEnd of Day Checklist\n\u007f Code committed to GitHub.\n\u007f Feature tested with sample PDFs.\n\u007f No major runtime errors.\n\u007f Ready to continue to next day."
          },
          {
            "page": 6,
            "text": "Expected Project Structure\n\u007f app.py - Streamlit UI\n\u007f loaders/pdf_loader.py - PDF extraction\n\u007f vector_store/chroma_store.py - Embeddings & Chroma\n\u007f chains/rag_chain.py - Retrieval pipeline\n\u007f utils/summarizer.py - Summary generation\n\u007f utils/quiz_generator.py - Quiz generation\n\u007f utils/flashcards.py - Flashcards\n\u007f utils/study_mode.py - One-click Study Mode\n\u007f prompts/prompts.py - Prompt templates\n\u007f requirements.txt and README.md\nDemo Flow\n\u007f Upload PDF.\n\u007f Show document statistics.\n\u007f Generate summary.\n\u007f Ask questions about the document.\n\u007f Explain a concept.\n\u007f Demonstrate semantic search with citations.\n\u007f Click Study Mode to generate summary, key takeaways, quiz, flashcards and suggested\nquestions.\n\u007f Conclude by explaining the RAG pipeline and technologies used."
