          },
          {
            "page": 9,
            "text": "Q: Is there a free tier for WhatsApp API? \nA: There is no traditional free tier, but you get free messaging in specific windows: \nreplies within 24 hours of a user-initiated message are free, and all templates within a 72-\nhour CTWA window are free. New accounts can also test with up to 250 messages/day at \nTier 0 without charges until they exceed the free window rules. \nQ: Can two WeNext accounts share the same WhatsApp number? \nA: No. A WhatsApp Business phone number can only be registered to one WhatsApp \nBusiness Account (WABA) at a time. One WABA can have multiple phone numbers, but \nnot the reverse. \nNeed help? Contact WeNext support at support@wenext.ai or reach your dedicated account \nmanager on WhatsApp.\nWeNext.ai  |  Meta & WhatsApp Business FAQ  |  Page 10"
